004</xref>; <xref ref-type="other" rid="bib26">Hurwitz <italic>et al</italic>, 2004</xref>; <xref ref-type="other" rid="bib52">Tournigand <italic>et al</italic>, 2004</xref>) Iri&#x0003d;irinotecan; Ox&#x0003d;oxaliplatin; Cap&#x0003d;capecitabine; bev&#x0003d;bevacizumab; cet&#x0003d;cetuximab; BSC&#x0003d;best supportive care.</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" mime-subtype="jpeg" xlink:href="95-6603233f2"/></fig><table-wrap id="tbl1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Summary of frequently used bolus and infusional 5-FU&#x0002f;FA regimens</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="left"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Regimens</bold></th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Doses and schedules of administration</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Mayo Clinic Regimen (<xref ref-type="other" rid="bib45">Saltz <italic>et al</italic>, 2000</xref>)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">5-FU (425&#x02009;mg&#x02009;m<sup>&#x02212;2</sup>&#x02009;day<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>) i.v. bolus&#x0002b;FA (20&#x02009;mg&#x02009;m<sup>&#x02212;2</sup>&#x02009;day<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>) daily days 1&#x02013;5 every 4 weeks</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Saltz (modified Roswell Park regimen) (<xref ref-type="other" rid="bib45">Saltz <italic>et al</italic>, 2000</xref>)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">5-FU (500&#x02009;mg&#x02009;m<sup>&#x02212;2</sup>&#x02009;day<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>) i.v. bolus&#x0002b;FA (20&#x02009;mg&#x02009;m<sup>&#x02212;2</sup>&#x02009;day<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>) weekly for 4 weeks every 6 weeks</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">De Gramont (<xref ref-type="other" rid="bib7">de Gramont <italic>et al</italic>, 1997</xref>)</td><td al